# PLAN_REVIEW-01 reviewer pixel-stability probe (read-only, session evidence)

Role: PLAN_REVIEWER (independent). Method: decode each saved frame with ImageIO through a Swift
script fed on stdin (`swift -`), rasterize to RGBA8 sRGB top-left origin in a CGBitmapContext,
then compare raw RGBA bytes per horizontal band between adjacent frames. The probe wrote no files
and performed no LINE/UI operation; only saved material in catalog-diagnostic-20261010/ was read.

Source frames (all 654x1286): scan-000.png, scan-001.png, scan-002.png, scan-003.png.
Note: buffer rows are vertically flipped relative to display top-down rows;
display_y = height - 1 - buffer_y. Probe A below ran in buffer coordinates; Probe B ran in
display (top-down) coordinates. An earlier exploratory run with mislabeled ROI bands was
superseded by Probe A/B; no claim relies on it.

